  "groundingSupports": [
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 554,
        "endIndex": 827,
        "text": "#### **[0], [11], [14] Google Releases Gemini 4 Argon with High Output Limits & New Benchmarks**\n* **Confirmed:** Google DeepMind announced *Gemini 4 Argon*, its next-generation frontier AI model focused on software engineering, enterprise knowledge work, and cyber defense"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 829,
        "endIndex": 988,
        "text": "Google introduced a 1M-token output limit (up from 64K in previous models) with introductory API pricing of $2 per 1M input tokens and $10 per 1M output tokens"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 990,
        "endIndex": 1233,
        "text": "Independent evaluator Artificial Analysis confirmed Argon (high reasoning) tied OpenAI's GPT-6 Astra (max) at 53 on its Intelligence Index while posting a significantly lower 15% hallucination rate on AA-Omniscience (compared to 51% for Astra)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        2,
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1235,
        "endIndex": 1391,
        "text": "* **Caveats:** The model is currently rolling out through trusted partner testing and US government pre-release evaluation before full public API deployment"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        3,
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1393,
        "endIndex": 1516,
        "text": "Real-world software engineering performance versus benchmark scores remains under active discussion across developer forums"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1665,
        "endIndex": 1984,
        "text": "#### **[1] Tencent Signs $7B Deal with Oracle for Overseas Advanced AI Chips**\n* **Confirmed:** The *Financial Times* reported that Tencent signed a 5-year, ~$7 billion agreement with Oracle to access roughly 100,000 advanced AI chips hosted in Oracle’s Southeast Asian data centers (including Malaysia and Indonesia)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2031,
        "endIndex": 2117,
        "text": "Reuters picked up the report but noted it could not independently verify exact figures"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2119,
        "endIndex": 2262,
        "text": "The deal relies on leasing cloud compute capacity in data centers located outside mainland China to remain compliant with US export regulations"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2337,
        "endIndex": 2639,
        "text": "#### **[15] California Signs \"No Robo Bosses Act\" (SB 947) Banning AI-Only Firings**\n* **Confirmed:** California Governor Gavin Newsom signed SB 947 into law, making California the first US state to prohibit employers from relying solely on automated decision systems (AI) to fire or discipline workers"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        6,
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2641,
        "endIndex": 2785,
        "text": "Where AI serves as the primary basis for disciplinary action, human reviewers must independently corroborate the finding using secondary records"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2787,
        "endIndex": 2838,
        "text": "* **Caveats:** The law takes effect on July 1, 2027"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2840,
        "endIndex": 2966,
        "text": "Pre-notification requirements were removed following a veto of a broader 2025 bill, and gig-worker provisions were scaled back"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3041,
        "endIndex": 3321,
        "text": "#### **[9] Amazon & Constellation Energy Sign 20-Year Nuclear Power Agreement**\n* **Confirmed:** Constellation Energy and Amazon announced a 20-year power purchase agreement supporting over $3 billion in infrastructure investment at the Calvert Cliffs nuclear facility in Maryland"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3323,
        "endIndex": 3411,
        "text": "The deal covers 690 megawatts (MW) of power, including 190 MW of new generating capacity"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3413,
        "endIndex": 3507,
        "text": "* **Caveats:** The 190 MW capacity expansion is scheduled to come online between 2030 and 2032"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3509,
        "endIndex": 3667,
        "text": "Power will feed directly into the 13-state PJM regional grid under a retail agreement rather than via a direct physical wire to an isolated data center campus"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3742,
        "endIndex": 4135,
        "text": "#### **[12] Grindr Acquires Telehealth Provider PurposeMed for $250 Million**\n* **Confirmed:** Grindr signed a definitive agreement to acquire PurposeMed Inc., parent company of HIV-prevention telehealth platform Freddie, for a base purchase price of $250 million ($190 million in cash and $60 million in common stock), plus up to $70 million in performance-based earnouts tied to 2027 targets"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        10,
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4137,
        "endIndex": 4225,
        "text": "* **Caveats:** Subject to customary closing conditions, with closing expected in Q4 2026"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4227,
        "endIndex": 4304,
        "text": "Initial expansion investments will temporarily dilute combined EBITDA margins"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4379,
        "endIndex": 4744,
        "text": "#### **[4] WSJ: Internal Documents Show Google Researchers Concerned Over AI Risks to Children**\n* **Confirmed:** *The Wall Street Journal* reported that internal Google documents and research sources warned of potential cognitive, emotional, and social dependency risks for children as Google pushed Gemini AI features across Chromebooks and K–12 classroom tools"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        12
      ]
    }
  ],
